      "title": "Image Preprocessing for Surface Defect Classification",
      "bullets": [
        "Implemented assigned image resizing, grayscale normalization, and patch extraction routines for surface defect classification using an established preprocessing specification.",
        "Checked processed samples against annotation files and documented mismatched labels and boundary handling issues for review within the existing experimental workflow."
      ]
    }
